{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../orchestrator/", "title": "Orchestrator"}, "next": {"link": "../utilities/", "title": "Utilities"}, "title": "Plugins", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"plugins\">\n<h1>Plugins<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#plugins\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-plugins-plugin-manager\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>Module for managing plugin initialization and finalization.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginManager</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">plugins</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Class responsible for managing plugins, providing methods for initialization and finalization.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>plugins</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassPlugin\"><em>BaseClassPlugin</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.set_owner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the owner (agent/orchestrator) reference for plugins that need it.</p>\n<p>This is called by the agent or orchestrator during initialization to provide\nplugins with access to the owner instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>owner</strong> \u2013 The agent or orchestrator instance that owns these plugins</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.plugin_info\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">plugin_info</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.plugin_info\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Log information about all managed plugins.</p>\n<p>This method iterates through all cached plugin instances and logs their names and types.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.initialize_plugins\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize_plugins</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.initialize_plugins\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initialize all plugins using the cached plugin instances.</p>\n<p>Calls the initialize method on each plugin that has it.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.finalize_plugins\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize_plugins</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.finalize_plugins\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalize all plugins using the cached plugin instances.</p>\n<p>Calls the finalize method on each plugin that has it.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.get_plugin\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_plugin</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">plugin_name</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.get_plugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get a specific plugin instance by name.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>plugin_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>) \u2013 The name of the plugin to retrieve.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The plugin instance if found, otherwise None.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><em>PluginProtocol</em></a> | None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-plugins-plugin-protocols\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>plugin_protocols module.\nThis module defines the interfaces (protocols) that plugins must implement to be integrated\nwith the PyOrchestrate framework. The interfaces provide a standardized structure for:\n- Plugin initialization (setup).\n- Execution of the main plugin logic.\n- Finalization (cleanup) after use.</p>\n<p>The protocols defined in this module ensure that every plugin adheres to a common contract,\nthus promoting consistency and interoperability within the system.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Base protocol for all plugins.</p>\n<p>This protocol defines the essential methods required for managing a plugin\u2019s lifecycle:\n- set_owner: Sets the owner (agent/orchestrator) reference for the plugin.\n- initialize: Prepares the plugin by allocating resources or setting up the initial state.\n- finalize: Handles cleanup and resource release.</p>\n<p>Developers must implement these methods to ensure proper integration with the system.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol.set_owner\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the owner (agent/orchestrator) reference for the plugin.</p>\n<p>This method is called by the agent or orchestrator during initialization to provide\nthe plugin with access to the owner instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>owner</strong> \u2013 The agent or orchestrator instance that owns this plugin</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol.initialize\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol.initialize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the plugin.</p>\n<p>Called only once at the time of plugin registration.\nUse this method to set up the necessary resources for subsequent execution.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol.finalize\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol.finalize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the plugin.</p>\n<p>Called at the end of the plugin lifecycle to release resources, close connections,\nor perform any other cleanup operations.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-plugins-com\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">SocketType</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">names</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">module</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">qualname</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">type</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">start</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">1</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">boundary</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/enum.html#enum.IntEnum\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">IntEnum</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Enum for ZeroMQ socket types.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>PUB</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Publish socket type.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>SUB</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Subscribe socket type.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>REQ</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Request socket type.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>REP</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Reply socket type.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>PUSH</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Push socket type.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>PULL</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Pull socket type.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ROUTER</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Router socket type.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>DEALER</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Dealer socket type.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>PAIR</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Pair socket type.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.PUB\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PUB</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">1</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.PUB\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.SUB\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">SUB</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">2</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.SUB\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.REQ\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">REQ</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">3</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.REQ\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.REP\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">REP</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">4</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.REP\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.PUSH\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PUSH</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">8</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.PUSH\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.PULL\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PULL</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">7</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.PULL\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.ROUTER\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ROUTER</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">6</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.ROUTER\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.DEALER\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DEALER</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">5</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.DEALER\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.PAIR\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PAIR</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">0</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.PAIR\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ZeroMQPubSub</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">address</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">socket_type</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">subscribe_topic</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">b''</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">context</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></code></a></p>\n<p>ZeroMQ Pub/Sub communication plugin.</p>\n<p>This plugin provides communication using ZeroMQ Pub/Sub sockets.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPubSub</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">zmq_plugin</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPubSub</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://localhost:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PUB</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">zmq_plugin</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">zmq_plugin</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">b</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Hello, World!&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Context</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ context.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Socket</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ socket.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>address</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket_type</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>subscribe_topic</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>Context</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.initialize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.initialize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.finalize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.finalize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.recv\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.recv\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.send\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.send\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>topic</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.MessageTracker\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>MessageTracker</em></a> | None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.setsockopt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">setsockopt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.setsockopt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sets a socket option.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.socket\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">socket</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><span class=\"pre\">Socket</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.socket\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id0\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">setsockopt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">option</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id0\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id1\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id1\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id2\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id2\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id3\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id3\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>If blocking is True, the receive operation blocks until a message arrives.</p></li>\n<li><p>If blocking is False, the receive returns immediately and may raise zmq.error.Again\nif no message is available.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 Whether to block or not. Defaults to True.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The received message.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If no message is available and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id4\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">topic</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">b''</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id4\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>) \u2013 The message to be sent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>topic</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 The topic to use for the message. Defaults to b\u201d\u201d.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 <p>If True, the blocking (bool, optional) operation blocks until</p>\n<p>complete. If False, returns immediately and may raise</p>\n<p>zmq.error.Again if the message cannot be queued. Defaults to True.</p>\n</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The result of the send operation or None.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>(<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.MessageTracker\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\">zmq.MessageTracker</a> | None)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If the message cannot be queued and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.set_owner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPubSub.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the owner (agent/orchestrator) reference for the plugin.</p>\n<p>This method is called by the agent or orchestrator during initialization to provide\nthe plugin with access to the owner instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>owner</strong> \u2013 The agent or orchestrator instance that owns this plugin</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ZeroMQReqRep</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">address</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">socket_type</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">context</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></code></a></p>\n<p>ZeroMQ REQ/REP communication plugin.</p>\n<p>This plugin provides communication using ZeroMQ REQ/REP sockets.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQReqRep</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">reqrep</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQReqRep</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://localhost:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">REQ</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">reqrep</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">reqrep</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">b</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Hello&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">reply</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">reqrep</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">recv</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Context</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ context.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Socket</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ socket.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>address</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket_type</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>Context</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.initialize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.initialize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.send\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.send\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.recv\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.recv\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.finalize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.finalize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.socket\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">socket</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><span class=\"pre\">Socket</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.socket\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id5\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id5\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n<p>For zmq.REQ, connects to the address.\nFor zmq.REP, binds to the address.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id6\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id6\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<p>For SocketType.REQ, sends the request.\nFor SocketType.REP, sends the reply.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>) \u2013 The message to be sent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 <p>If True, the blocking (bool, optional) operation blocks until</p>\n<p>complete. If False, returns immediately and may raise</p>\n<p>zmq.error.Again if the message cannot be queued. Defaults to True.</p>\n</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If the message cannot be queued and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id7\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id7\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>If blocking is True, the receive operation blocks until a message arrives.</p></li>\n<li><p>If blocking is False, the receive returns immediately and may raise zmq.error.Again\nif no message is available.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 Whether to block or not. Defaults to True.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The received message.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If no message is available and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id8\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id8\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.set_owner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQReqRep.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the owner (agent/orchestrator) reference for the plugin.</p>\n<p>This method is called by the agent or orchestrator during initialization to provide\nthe plugin with access to the owner instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>owner</strong> \u2013 The agent or orchestrator instance that owns this plugin</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ZeroMQPushPull</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">address</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">socket_type</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">context</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">hwm</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></code></a></p>\n<p>ZeroMQ PUSH/PULL communication plugin.</p>\n<p>This plugin provides communication using ZeroMQ PUSH/PULL sockets for\ndistributed pipeline processing.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Producer (PUSH)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPushPull</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">push</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPushPull</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://localhost:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PUSH</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">push</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">push</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">b</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Task data&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Worker (PULL)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pull</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPushPull</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://localhost:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PULL</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pull</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">task</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">pull</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">recv</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Context</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ context.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Socket</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ socket.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>address</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket_type</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>Context</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>hwm</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.initialize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.initialize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.send\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.send\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.recv\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.recv\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.finalize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.finalize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.socket\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">socket</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><span class=\"pre\">Socket</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.socket\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id9\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id9\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n<p>For SocketType.PUSH, the socket binds to the address.\nFor SocketType.PULL, the socket connects to the address.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id10\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id10\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ PUSH socket.</p>\n<p>This method is only valid for SocketType.PUSH sockets.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>) \u2013 The message to be sent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 <p>If True, the blocking (bool, optional) operation blocks until</p>\n<p>complete. If False, returns immediately and may raise</p>\n<p>zmq.error.Again if the message cannot be queued. Defaults to True.</p>\n</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#RuntimeError\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><strong>RuntimeError</strong></a> \u2013 If used with a SocketType.PULL socket.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If the message cannot be queued and blocking is False.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id11\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id11\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ PULL.</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>If blocking is True, the receive operation blocks until a message arrives.</p></li>\n<li><p>If blocking is False, the receive returns immediately and may raise zmq.error.Again\nif no message is available.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 Whether to block or not. Defaults to True.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The received message.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#RuntimeError\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><strong>RuntimeError</strong></a> \u2013 If used with a PUSH socket.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If no message is available and blocking is False.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id12\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id12\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.set_owner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPushPull.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the owner (agent/orchestrator) reference for the plugin.</p>\n<p>This method is called by the agent or orchestrator during initialization to provide\nthe plugin with access to the owner instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>owner</strong> \u2013 The agent or orchestrator instance that owns this plugin</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ZeroMQRouterDealer</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">address</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">socket_type</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">context</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identity</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">hwm</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></code></a></p>\n<p>ZeroMQ ROUTER/DEALER communication plugin.</p>\n<p>This plugin provides advanced request/reply routing using ZeroMQ ROUTER/DEALER sockets.\nROUTER sockets can handle multiple clients and route messages based on client identity.\nDEALER sockets can connect to multiple services and load balance requests.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Server side with ROUTER</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">router</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQRouterDealer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://*:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ROUTER</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">router</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">identity</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">message</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">router</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">recv_multipart</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">router</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send_multipart</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">identity</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sa\">b</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Response&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Client side with DEALER</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">dealer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQRouterDealer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://localhost:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DEALER</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">dealer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">dealer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">b</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Request&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">response</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">dealer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">recv</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Context</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ context.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Socket</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ socket.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>address</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket_type</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>Context</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>identity</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>hwm</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.initialize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.initialize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.send\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.send\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.recv\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.recv\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.send_multipart\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send_multipart</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.send_multipart\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a multipart message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message_parts</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>list</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a><em>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.recv_multipart\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv_multipart</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.recv_multipart\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a multipart message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">list</a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.finalize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.finalize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.socket\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">socket</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><span class=\"pre\">Socket</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.socket\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id13\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id13\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n<p>For SocketType.ROUTER, the socket binds to the address.\nFor SocketType.DEALER, the socket connects to the address.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id14\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id14\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>) \u2013 The message to be sent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 <p>If True, the blocking (bool, optional) operation blocks until</p>\n<p>complete. If False, returns immediately and may raise</p>\n<p>zmq.error.Again if the message cannot be queued. Defaults to True.</p>\n</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If the message cannot be queued and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id15\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id15\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>If blocking is True, the receive operation blocks until a message arrives.</p></li>\n<li><p>If blocking is False, the receive returns immediately and may raise zmq.error.Again\nif no message is available.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 Whether to block or not. Defaults to True.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The received message.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If no message is available and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id16\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send_multipart</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message_parts</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id16\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a multipart message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<p>This is particularly useful for ROUTER sockets which need to route messages\nbased on client identity.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message_parts</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>list</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a><em>]</em>) \u2013 <p>The list of message parts</p>\n<p>to be sent.</p>\n</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 <p>If True, the blocking (bool, optional) operation blocks until</p>\n<p>complete. If False, returns immediately and may raise</p>\n<p>zmq.error.Again if the message cannot be queued. Defaults to True.</p>\n</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If the message cannot be queued and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id17\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv_multipart</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id17\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a multipart message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<p>This is particularly useful for ROUTER sockets which receive messages\nwith client identity as the first part.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 If True, the receive operation blocks until a\nmessage arrives. If False, the receive returns immediately and may\nraise zmq.error.Again if no message is available. Defaults to True.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The list of received message parts.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">list</a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If no message is available and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id18\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id18\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.set_owner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQRouterDealer.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the owner (agent/orchestrator) reference for the plugin.</p>\n<p>This method is called by the agent or orchestrator during initialization to provide\nthe plugin with access to the owner instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>owner</strong> \u2013 The agent or orchestrator instance that owns this plugin</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ZeroMQPair</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">address</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">bind</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">context</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">hwm</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></code></a></p>\n<p>ZeroMQ PAIR communication plugin.</p>\n<p>This plugin provides bidirectional communication using ZeroMQ PAIR sockets.\nPAIR sockets are designed for connecting two peers exclusively.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Peer A</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pair_a</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPair</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://*:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pair_a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pair_a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">b</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Hello from A&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">message</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">pair_a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">recv</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Peer B</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pair_b</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPair</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://localhost:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">bind</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pair_b</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">message</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">pair_b</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">recv</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pair_b</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">b</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Hello from B&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Context</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ context.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Socket</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ socket.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>address</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>bind</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>Context</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>hwm</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.initialize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.initialize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.send\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.send\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.recv\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.recv\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.finalize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.finalize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.socket\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">socket</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><span class=\"pre\">Socket</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.socket\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id19\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id19\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n<p>Creates a PAIR socket and either binds or connects based on configuration.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id20\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id20\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message using ZeroMQ PAIR socket.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bytes</em></a>) \u2013 The message to be sent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 <p>If True, the blocking (bool, optional) operation blocks until</p>\n<p>complete. If False, returns immediately and may raise</p>\n<p>zmq.error.Again if the message cannot be queued. Defaults to True.</p>\n</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If the message cannot be queued and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id21\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">recv</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">blocking</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id21\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receives a message using ZeroMQ PAIR.</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>If blocking is True, the receive operation blocks until a message arrives.</p></li>\n<li><p>If blocking is False, the receive returns immediately and may raise zmq.error.Again\nif no message is available.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>blocking</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 Whether to block or not. Defaults to True.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The received message.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bytes</a></p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Again\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><strong>zmq.error.Again</strong></a> \u2013 If no message is available and blocking is False.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id22\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id22\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.set_owner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPair.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the owner (agent/orchestrator) reference for the plugin.</p>\n<p>This method is called by the agent or orchestrator during initialization to provide\nthe plugin with access to the owner instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>owner</strong> \u2013 The agent or orchestrator instance that owns this plugin</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ZeroMQPoller</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">context</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></code></a></p>\n<p>ZeroMQ Poller utility for non-blocking operations across multiple sockets.</p>\n<p>This utility provides polling capabilities for multiple ZeroMQ sockets,\nallowing non-blocking operations and event-driven programming.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Create multiple sockets</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pub</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPubSub</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://*:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PUB</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">sub</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPubSub</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://localhost:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">SocketType</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SUB</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">pub</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">sub</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Create poller and register sockets</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">poller</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPoller</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">poller</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">poller</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">register</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sub</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">socket</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">zmq</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">POLLIN</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">poller</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">register</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pub</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">socket</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">zmq</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">POLLOUT</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Poll for events</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">events</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">poller</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">poll</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># 1 second timeout</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">socket</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">events</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"n\">zmq</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">POLLIN</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>        <span class=\"c1\"># Socket is ready for reading</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>        <span class=\"n\">message</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">socket</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">recv</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">zmq</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">NOBLOCK</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>    <span class=\"k\">elif</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"n\">zmq</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">POLLOUT</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>        <span class=\"c1\"># Socket is ready for writing</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>        <span class=\"n\">socket</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">b</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Hello&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">zmq</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">NOBLOCK</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>poller</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Poller\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Poller</em></a>) \u2013 The ZeroMQ poller instance.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Context\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>Context</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.initialize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.initialize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ poller.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.register\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">register</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.register\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Registers a socket with the poller.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>socket</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>Socket</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>flags</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.unregister\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">unregister</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.unregister\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Unregisters a socket from the poller.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>socket</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>Socket</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.poll\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">poll</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.poll\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Polls for events on registered sockets.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>timeout</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">list</a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#tuple\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">tuple</a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>Socket</em></a>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">int</a>]]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.finalize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.finalize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ poller.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.poller\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">poller</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Poller\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><span class=\"pre\">Poller</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.poller\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id23\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id23\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initializes the ZeroMQ poller.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id24\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">register</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">socket</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">flags=&lt;PollEvent.POLLIN:</span> <span class=\"pre\">1&gt;</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id24\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Registers a socket with the poller.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>socket</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Socket</em></a>) \u2013 The socket to register.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>flags</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 The polling flags (zmq.POLLIN, zmq.POLLOUT, or both).\nDefaults to zmq.POLLIN.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id25\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">unregister</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">socket</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id25\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Unregisters a socket from the poller.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>socket</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\"><em>zmq.Socket</em></a>) \u2013 The socket to unregister.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id26\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">poll</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timeout</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id26\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Polls for events on registered sockets.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>timeout</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) \u2013 The timeout in milliseconds. If None, blocks indefinitely.\nIf 0, returns immediately (non-blocking).\nDefaults to None.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>A list of (socket, event) tuples where</dt><dd><p>event is a bitmask of zmq.POLLIN, zmq.POLLOUT, etc.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">list</a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#tuple\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">tuple</a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://pyzmq.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/zmq.html#zmq.Socket\" title=\"(in PyZMQ v27.2)\">zmq.Socket</a>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">int</a>]]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id27\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id27\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalizes the ZeroMQ poller.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.set_owner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.ZeroMQPoller.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the owner (agent/orchestrator) reference for the plugin.</p>\n<p>This method is called by the agent or orchestrator during initialization to provide\nthe plugin with access to the owner instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>owner</strong> \u2013 The agent or orchestrator instance that owns this plugin</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-plugins-heartbeat\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>Plugin for agent heartbeat functionality.</p>\n<p>This module provides a plugin that agents can use to send periodic heartbeat\nmessages to the orchestrator for monitoring purposes.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_send_interval</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">30.0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_jitter</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0.1</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timeout_multiplier</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">3.0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">check_interval</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">5.0</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Orchestrator plugin that manages heartbeat monitoring for all agents.</p>\n<p>This plugin:\n1. Automatically injects heartbeat plugins into registered agents (if auto_inject=True)\n2. Monitors incoming heartbeat messages from agents\n3. Detects agents that have stopped sending heartbeats (timeout detection)\n4. Provides status and health information for all monitored agents</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>Example usage:</dt><dd><dl>\n<dt>heartbeat_plugin = OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin(</dt><dd><dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>config=HeartbeatConfig(</dt><dd><p>agent_send_interval=10.0,\ntimeout_multiplier=3.0,\nauto_inject=True</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>)</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>orchestrator = Orchestrator(</dt><dd><p>plugin=OrchestratorPlugin(heartbeat=heartbeat_plugin)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>agent_send_interval</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>agent_jitter</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>timeout_multiplier</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>check_interval</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.orchestrator\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">orchestrator</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../orchestrator/#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator\"><span class=\"pre\">Orchestrator</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.orchestrator\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get the orchestrator instance.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.set_owner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the orchestrator reference.</p>\n<p>Called by the orchestrator when the plugin is attached.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>orchestrator</strong> \u2013 The orchestrator instance</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>owner</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../orchestrator/#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator\"><em>Orchestrator</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.initialize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.initialize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initialize the heartbeat monitoring plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.finalize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.finalize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalize the heartbeat monitoring plugin.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.get_status\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_status</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.get_status\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get the current status of heartbeat monitoring.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Dictionary with monitoring status and agent health information</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">dict</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.get_healthy_agents\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_healthy_agents</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.get_healthy_agents\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get set of agents that are currently healthy (not timed out).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Set\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Set</em></a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">str</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.get_timeout_agents\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_timeout_agents</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.get_timeout_agents\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get set of agents that have timed out.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Set\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Set</em></a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">str</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.inject_agent_heartbeat_plugin\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">inject_agent_heartbeat_plugin</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">custom_plugin</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin.inject_agent_heartbeat_plugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Inject heartbeat plugin configuration into agent custom_plugin if auto_inject is enabled.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>custom_plugin</strong> \u2013 The custom_plugin object to modify or None</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Modified custom_plugin with heartbeat plugin injected if auto_inject is enabled</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">enabled</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">send_every</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">30.0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jitter</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0.1</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Plugin that sends periodic heartbeat messages to the orchestrator.</p>\n<p>This plugin is designed to be used as an attribute in an agent\u2019s Plugin class.\nIt automatically starts a background timer thread that sends AGENT_HEARTBEAT\nmessages at regular intervals.</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>Example usage:</dt><dd><dl>\n<dt>class MyAgent(PeriodicProcessAgent):</dt><dd><dl>\n<dt>class Plugin(PeriodicProcessAgent.Plugin):</dt><dd><dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>heartbeat = AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin(</dt><dd><p>enabled=True,\nsend_every=30.0,\njitter=0.1</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>plugin: Plugin</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>enabled</strong> \u2013 Whether the heartbeat is enabled</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>send_every</strong> \u2013 Interval in seconds between heartbeats</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>jitter</strong> \u2013 Random variation added to the interval (0.0 to 1.0)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>enabled</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>send_every</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>jitter</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin.set_owner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_owner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">owner</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin.set_owner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the owner (agent) reference.</p>\n<p>Called by the plugin manager to provide access to the owner instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>owner</strong> \u2013 The agent instance that owns this plugin</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin.initialize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">initialize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin.initialize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initialize the plugin. Called by the plugin manager.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin.finalize\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">finalize</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin.finalize\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Finalize the plugin. Called by the plugin manager.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin.get_status\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_status</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin.get_status\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get the current status of the heartbeat plugin.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Dictionary with plugin status information</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">dict</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["utilities", "Utilities", "N", "next"], ["orchestrator", "Orchestrator", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "plugins.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Plugins</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginManager</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.set_owner\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginManager.set_owner()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.plugin_info\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginManager.plugin_info()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.initialize_plugins\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginManager.initialize_plugins()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.finalize_plugins\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginManager.finalize_plugins()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_manager.PluginManager.get_plugin\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginManager.get_plugin()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol.set_owner\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol.set_owner()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol.initialize\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol.initialize()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol.finalize\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PluginProtocol.finalize()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com\">PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SocketType</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.com.SocketType.PUB\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SocketType.PUB</